- [CLOSE Statement](../control-flow/close-stmt.html)
- [WHILE Statement](../control-flow/while-stmt.html)
- [REPEAT Statement](../control-flow/repeat-stmt.html)
- [SQL Scripting](../sql-ref-scripting.html)

